# A local def that only covers part of a wider use (the IMPLICIT_DEF writes
# vgpr2_vgpr3, the store reads vgpr2_vgpr3_vgpr4_vgpr5) keeps the whole
# register as an external use of the bundle even though no lane of it is live
# at the bundle boundary.
